WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.670
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.940 --> 01:43.930
[Small Town Remedy]

3
01:44.130 --> 01:46.880
[Episode 21]

4
01:50.039 --> 01:50.840
President Li.

5
01:51.840 --> 01:52.950
This time,

6
01:53.200 --> 01:54.509
besides official business,

7
01:54.509 --> 01:56.509
I have a personal favor to ask of you.

8
01:57.280 --> 01:58.539
Come here for a second.

9
02:00.510 --> 02:01.640
This is the youngest

10
02:02.710 --> 02:04.000
and most hardworking doctor

11
02:04.000 --> 02:05.640
in our hospital,

12
02:05.790 --> 02:06.590
Dr. Che.

13
02:06.590 --> 02:07.280
Hello.

14
02:07.280 --> 02:07.950
Hello, President.

15
02:07.950 --> 02:09.030
Let me offer you a toast.

16
02:09.030 --> 02:09.800
Okay.

17
02:10.310 --> 02:11.570
She wants to get a Ph.D.

18
02:11.590 --> 02:14.390
We'll count on you for her recommendation letter.

19
02:14.590 --> 02:15.360
No problem.

20
02:15.590 --> 02:16.960
We'll be family soon.

21
02:18.240 --> 02:19.120
That's a different matter.

22
02:19.120 --> 02:20.360
Whether we'll be family or not,

23
02:20.360 --> 02:21.400
we don't know yet.

24
02:21.870 --> 02:23.030
But you have promised her this.

25
02:23.030 --> 02:24.160
I'll be the witness.

26
02:25.750 --> 02:26.360
Long,

27
02:26.360 --> 02:27.560
why are you so sneaky?

28
02:33.030 --> 02:34.160
Long, what's wrong?

29
02:35.280 --> 02:36.880
Something happened at home.

30
02:39.590 --> 02:43.750
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

31
02:40.400 --> 02:42.280
All staff members,

32
02:42.280 --> 02:44.680
-please report to the outpatient hall on the first floor. -Have you seen Chen Junnan?

33
02:44.040 --> 02:46.220
[No smoking] [Keep quiet]

34
02:44.710 --> 02:46.030
Didn't he ask for leave?

35
02:46.030 --> 02:46.960
No.

36
02:47.310 --> 02:49.150
He was supposed to come this afternoon

37
02:49.150 --> 02:50.430
to attend the inquiry by

38
02:50.430 --> 02:51.710
the Medical Association's Investigation Team.

39
02:51.710 --> 02:52.710
He's not answering his phone

40
02:52.710 --> 02:53.710
or replying to his messages.

41
02:53.710 --> 02:54.680
What's going on?

42
02:55.710 --> 02:57.370
Based on what I know about him,

43
02:57.430 --> 02:58.870
he's probably hiding.

44
02:59.430 --> 03:00.240
Hiding?

45
03:00.520 --> 03:00.840
No.

46
03:00.840 --> 03:02.430
How could he possibly avoid something this big?

47
03:00.900 --> 03:02.760
[Immunology Laboratory]

48
03:02.760 --> 03:07.450
[Biochemistry Laboratory] [Laboratory]

49
03:02.910 --> 03:04.080
He probably found a quiet place

50
03:04.080 --> 03:05.360
to think things through.

51
03:05.360 --> 03:06.190
Otherwise, he won't be able to get over it

52
03:06.190 --> 03:07.520
for the rest of his life.

53
03:08.080 --> 03:09.030
This won't do.

54
03:09.430 --> 03:10.190
We have to find him

55
03:10.190 --> 03:11.250
and bring him here.

56
03:12.430 --> 03:13.430
How do we find him?

57
03:13.430 --> 03:15.030
It's like looking for a needle in a haystack.

58
03:15.030 --> 03:15.680
Right.

59
03:15.680 --> 03:16.280
In such a situation,

60
03:16.160 --> 03:20.940
[Blood Test Department]

61
03:16.280 --> 03:19.010
not even the police station will accept the case.

62
03:19.800 --> 03:20.590
Wait.

63
03:20.750 --> 03:22.079
He's your best friend.

64
03:21.750 --> 03:23.610
[Security Room]

65
03:22.400 --> 03:23.710
Aren't you afraid something might happen to him?

66
03:23.710 --> 03:24.910
What's the use of being afraid?

67
03:24.910 --> 03:26.840
He has to rely on himself for many things.

68
03:26.840 --> 03:28.280
Can you stay by his side 24 hours a day

69
03:28.280 --> 03:30.150
for the rest of his life?

70
03:35.870 --> 03:36.870
Nonsense.

71
03:37.400 --> 03:38.360
You know Secretary Lyu, right?

72
03:38.360 --> 03:40.290
He's with the president every day.

73
03:48.030 --> 03:49.090
Hello, President.

74
03:49.360 --> 03:51.360
-President Long. -President Long.

75
03:56.190 --> 03:57.560
Dear colleagues,

76
03:59.800 --> 04:00.750
in the past period of time,

77
04:00.750 --> 04:02.840
you must have heard a lot of

78
04:03.430 --> 04:04.520
various rumors.

79
04:06.430 --> 04:09.230
Like how Xiaoximen Hospital can't make ends meet,

80
04:12.190 --> 04:14.680
how the higher-ups are putting pressure on us,

81
04:14.680 --> 04:17.209
and how Xiaoximen Hospital is going to close.

82
04:17.800 --> 04:18.920
I'm here

83
04:18.920 --> 04:20.430
to tell you clearly that

84
04:21.070 --> 04:22.190
they are all true.

85
04:24.600 --> 04:26.190
No way, President Long.

86
04:26.430 --> 04:27.240
Are we doomed?

87
04:27.240 --> 04:28.040
You're kidding, right?

88
04:28.040 --> 04:28.870
Director Long.

89
04:28.870 --> 04:30.930
W-We can't just close down like this.

90
04:31.360 --> 04:32.000
Right?

91
04:32.040 --> 04:33.000
You're kidding, right?

92
04:33.000 --> 04:34.460
We're such a big hospital.

93
04:37.950 --> 04:38.950
I hereby announce

94
04:39.920 --> 04:42.250
that Xiaoximen Hospital will officially

95
04:42.360 --> 04:45.600
begin liquidation proceedings today.

96
04:47.190 --> 04:48.790
As for what the future holds,

97
04:49.159 --> 04:51.159
what will happen to your positions,

98
04:52.270 --> 04:54.400
and how compensation will be settled—

99
04:55.310 --> 04:58.020
everyone should just go home and wait for further notice.

100
04:58.020 --> 05:03.530
[Life lies in exercise. Health lies in prevention.]

101
05:11.750 --> 05:12.950
You look pretty calm.

102
05:14.510 --> 05:15.800
If I can pursue a Ph.D.,

103
05:15.870 --> 05:18.070
I would have to leave for a while anyway.

104
05:19.430 --> 05:20.830
Huang is the amazing one.

105
05:21.070 --> 05:23.530
He has the longest tenure in our department.

106
05:23.680 --> 05:24.950
If the hospital closes,

107
05:24.950 --> 05:26.390
he suffers the biggest loss.

108
05:26.390 --> 05:27.190
Look at him.

109
05:27.680 --> 05:28.630
Steady as a rock.

110
05:29.310 --> 05:30.120
Long!

111
05:30.870 --> 05:31.800
L-Long!

112
05:32.920 --> 05:33.720
Long.

113
05:33.800 --> 05:34.600
Didn't he say...

114
05:34.600 --> 05:35.390
Didn't he say he has a way?

115
05:35.390 --> 05:35.720
Where is he?

116
05:35.720 --> 05:36.480
Left, left, left.

117
05:36.480 --> 05:37.000
Long!

118
05:37.000 --> 05:37.720
Left!

119
05:39.040 --> 05:40.840
Don't you have a solution, Long?

120
05:41.370 --> 05:45.230
[Emergency Unit]

121
05:43.630 --> 05:44.430
Ma'am.

122
05:45.159 --> 05:45.950
Ma'am!

123
05:47.360 --> 05:48.159
Ma'am.

124
05:48.800 --> 05:50.720
Please, have mercy on me.

125
05:51.330 --> 05:53.790
[Boiler Room]

126
05:51.600 --> 05:52.480
Ma'am!

127
05:53.720 --> 05:54.510
Ma'am!

128
05:53.900 --> 05:54.630
[Emergency Room]

129
05:54.990 --> 05:56.120
[Emergency Room]

130
05:55.159 --> 05:57.070
I beg you to have mercy.

131
05:57.680 --> 06:00.000
Please let my Xu Ling off the hook.

132
06:00.000 --> 06:00.800
Ma'am!

133
06:02.800 --> 06:03.920
Please let her go.

134
06:03.060 --> 06:07.440
[Emergency Room]

135
06:03.920 --> 06:05.240
The hospital is closed.

136
06:05.240 --> 06:06.770
They still aren't leaving?

137
06:07.240 --> 06:09.800
The compensation probably hasn't been settled.

138
06:09.800 --> 06:11.860
Is the one kneeling Xu Ling's father?

139
06:12.190 --> 06:14.070
Didn't they say all the inpatients

140
06:14.070 --> 06:15.750
were transferred to Second Hospital?

141
06:15.750 --> 06:17.810
It seems only his family hasn't left.

142
06:25.000 --> 06:26.460
Thanks for your hard work.

143
06:27.870 --> 06:28.680
Dr. Zhong,

144
06:28.950 --> 06:30.560
you haven't gotten off work yet?

145
06:30.560 --> 06:31.360
Our patient hasn't left yet.

146
06:31.360 --> 06:32.360
How can we leave?

147
06:32.750 --> 06:34.510
I have to see my duty through to the very end.

148
06:34.510 --> 06:35.640
Come, hold on tight.

149
06:47.310 --> 06:50.110
Does changing the dressing really hurt that much?

150
06:50.120 --> 06:51.159
It's not the pain.

151
06:53.190 --> 06:54.790
I don't want to live anymore.

152
06:57.390 --> 06:59.190
Are you crying because of guilt,

153
06:59.310 --> 07:01.170
or are you afraid of going to jail?

154
07:02.680 --> 07:03.480
Both.

155
07:12.720 --> 07:13.650
Do you regret it?

156
07:17.750 --> 07:19.150
You're only 19 years old.

157
07:19.630 --> 07:20.750
If the law doesn't require you to

158
07:20.750 --> 07:22.480
pay with your life for a life taken,

159
07:22.480 --> 07:23.360
never say anything

160
07:23.360 --> 07:24.600
about not wanting to live.

161
07:24.600 --> 07:25.870
Easy for you to say.

162
07:26.720 --> 07:28.520
You're not the one going to jail.

163
07:33.310 --> 07:34.270
I have a friend.

164
07:35.390 --> 07:37.560
He's about your age.

165
07:39.480 --> 07:41.340
If he could trade places with you,

166
07:42.000 --> 07:43.800
he would probably be very happy.

167
07:45.630 --> 07:46.480
Why?

168
07:47.720 --> 07:49.050
Did he kill someone too?

169
07:49.360 --> 07:50.620
He didn't kill anyone,

170
07:52.270 --> 07:53.390
but he's very sick.

171
07:54.070 --> 07:55.200
Time is running out.

172
07:57.190 --> 07:58.520
He once said something.

173
08:00.430 --> 08:02.960
He said you only have choices if you're alive.

174
08:03.920 --> 08:06.050
Now, I'm passing these words on to you.

175
08:07.190 --> 08:08.800
If you feel guilty,

176
08:09.510 --> 08:11.160
then live on with that guilt.

177
08:12.190 --> 08:13.510
If you don't care,

178
08:14.390 --> 08:15.360
then at least...

179
08:16.680 --> 08:19.010
at least live on with the lessons learned.

180
08:20.600 --> 08:23.000
Staying alive is the most important thing.

181
08:26.120 --> 08:27.000
May I know...

182
08:30.160 --> 08:32.960
which company is taking over Xiaoximen Hospital?

183
08:32.960 --> 08:34.000
Not for now.

184
08:34.669 --> 08:36.929
We are in contact with multiple parties.

185
08:37.390 --> 08:39.030
We won't come to a decision so soon.

186
08:39.030 --> 08:40.600
So many companies

187
08:40.600 --> 08:42.320
are interested in Xiaoximen.

188
08:43.320 --> 08:43.960
Doesn't this show

189
08:43.960 --> 08:45.550
the value of our hospital?

190
08:48.000 --> 08:48.930
President Long.

191
08:50.510 --> 08:51.870
For us ordinary people,

192
08:51.870 --> 08:52.840
and I mean

193
08:52.840 --> 08:54.550
for the vast majority of ordinary people,

194
08:54.550 --> 08:55.750
if they get sick,

195
08:56.030 --> 08:57.000
where is the first place they would consider

196
08:57.000 --> 08:58.080
to go for medical treatment?

197
08:58.080 --> 08:59.210
A Grade 3A hospital.

198
09:00.390 --> 09:02.120
But there are also challenges.

199
09:02.960 --> 09:04.120
Come on.

200
09:04.320 --> 09:06.520
How much cheaper can you be than others?

201
09:06.670 --> 09:07.390
Besides,

202
09:07.390 --> 09:08.720
who will bear the losses

203
09:09.000 --> 09:09.790
you caused?

204
09:09.790 --> 09:12.250
At least I didn't let the government bear it.

205
09:12.360 --> 09:13.560
Haven't you checked?

206
09:14.910 --> 09:15.720
The government's funding

207
09:15.720 --> 09:16.870
is less than

208
09:16.870 --> 09:18.270
10% of our total revenue.

209
09:21.000 --> 09:21.790
Long.

210
09:22.480 --> 09:24.200
I know you are very capable.

211
09:24.670 --> 09:25.670
If you hadn't used those

212
09:25.670 --> 09:27.390
messy methods to drag it out,

213
09:27.480 --> 09:29.750
this Xiaoximen Hospital would have closed down long ago.

214
09:29.750 --> 09:31.510
The timing of this accident

215
09:32.320 --> 09:33.520
is too coincidental.

216
09:33.670 --> 09:35.200
This is God's will.

217
09:35.270 --> 09:36.360
What a load of crap.

218
09:37.670 --> 09:39.070
If God makes people sick,

219
09:39.320 --> 09:41.650
wouldn't you try to go against God's will?

220
09:41.870 --> 09:43.030
Aren't you tired?

221
09:44.840 --> 09:45.630
Come in.

222
09:50.600 --> 09:51.360
President.

223
09:52.200 --> 09:53.130
President Long.

224
09:53.200 --> 09:54.800
I guessed you two would come.

225
09:55.120 --> 09:56.030
Yes, this...

226
09:56.670 --> 09:58.130
Sorry for all the trouble.

227
10:01.600 --> 10:02.550
Please don't bother, President Long.

228
10:02.550 --> 10:03.200
It's hot.

229
10:11.600 --> 10:12.390
Well...

230
10:13.030 --> 10:14.090
About this matter,

231
10:16.270 --> 10:18.030
I have to say what needs to be said.

232
10:18.030 --> 10:18.670
Yes.

233
10:22.150 --> 10:23.960
The estimated fine is

234
10:26.720 --> 10:28.650
between 800,000 and 900,000 yuan.

235
10:29.630 --> 10:30.240
Well...

236
10:33.150 --> 10:33.960
Well...

237
10:34.240 --> 10:36.080
Junnan sent me a message.

238
10:36.840 --> 10:37.600
He says...

239
10:38.670 --> 10:41.270
He is willing to use his savings over the years,

240
10:41.440 --> 10:42.390
and the money my wife and I

241
10:42.390 --> 10:44.320
were going to use to buy him a house,

242
10:44.840 --> 10:45.670
to...

243
10:46.670 --> 10:48.670
to give it to the patient's family.

244
10:49.390 --> 10:50.200
We...

245
10:51.120 --> 10:53.030
He is too impulsive.

246
10:53.030 --> 10:53.750
Yes.

247
10:57.270 --> 10:58.360
Actually,

248
10:58.790 --> 10:59.630
it cannot be determined

249
10:59.630 --> 11:02.030
that Chen Junnan acted intentionally

250
11:04.790 --> 11:06.440
or with negligence.

251
11:06.440 --> 11:07.720
He definitely didn't do it on purpose.

252
11:07.720 --> 11:08.440
President.

253
11:10.240 --> 11:12.240
The hospital's insurance will pay.

254
11:12.960 --> 11:13.600
T-Then...

255
11:13.600 --> 11:16.070
Whatever the punishment is,

256
11:16.600 --> 11:18.200
if it's our responsibility,

257
11:18.440 --> 11:19.360
our family will bear it.

258
11:19.360 --> 11:20.550
I-It's just that right now...

259
11:20.550 --> 11:21.390
W-We...

260
11:29.150 --> 11:30.390
The personal fine will be 50,000 yuan.

261
11:30.390 --> 11:31.440
While the finance staff is still here,

262
11:31.440 --> 11:32.870
go pay the money quickly.

263
11:33.510 --> 11:34.240
Brother.

264
11:34.240 --> 11:35.170
President Long.

265
11:35.440 --> 11:37.970
-Thank you, brother. I... -Thank you so much.

266
11:39.320 --> 11:40.120
I...

267
11:40.910 --> 11:41.630
Hubby.

268
11:41.670 --> 11:43.470
Let's hurry and go pay the money.

269
11:43.910 --> 11:44.790
Thank you.

270
11:44.790 --> 11:46.390
Hurry up, Hubby. Hurry.

271
12:08.730 --> 12:10.840
[Xiaoximen Hospital] [Name: Che Mingming]

272
12:38.960 --> 12:39.630
Mingming,

273
12:41.390 --> 12:42.320
I've learned it.

274
12:42.320 --> 12:42.870
I finally know

275
12:42.870 --> 12:44.000
how to open this door.

276
12:44.000 --> 12:44.630
Look.

277
12:52.670 --> 12:53.670
Congratulations!

278
12:53.670 --> 12:55.730
You finally made it through the door.

279
12:57.120 --> 12:58.080
Unfortunately,

280
12:59.630 --> 13:01.030
there's no door anymore.

281
13:09.450 --> 13:11.520
[Guanghua Road] [Dongdaqiao Road]

282
13:11.630 --> 13:13.050
[Our ultimate goal is to ensure a stress-free move for our customers.]

283
13:12.120 --> 13:12.910
As for you,

284
13:13.360 --> 13:14.670
for violating company rules

285
13:14.670 --> 13:15.720
and fighting,

286
13:16.150 --> 13:17.950
we have no choice but to fire you.

287
13:18.910 --> 13:24.080
[Beijing Chengyi Moving Company]

288
13:19.360 --> 13:20.000
How can this be considered

289
13:20.000 --> 13:20.910
fighting?

290
13:21.510 --> 13:22.360
I was helping someone.

291
13:22.360 --> 13:22.960
Someone was getting beaten up,

292
13:22.960 --> 13:24.890
so I went over to do the right thing.

293
13:29.360 --> 13:30.480
Stop fighting!

294
13:31.630 --> 13:32.840
You even got support, huh?

295
13:32.840 --> 13:33.390
What?

296
13:33.390 --> 13:34.600
I am not support!

297
13:34.750 --> 13:35.790
Don't even think about it.

298
13:35.790 --> 13:36.600
I was just passing by!

299
13:36.600 --> 13:37.870
I was beaten up like this.

300
13:37.870 --> 13:39.240
I couldn't just stand there.

301
13:39.240 --> 13:40.240
It was self-defense.

302
13:40.240 --> 13:41.480
I don't have time

303
13:41.870 --> 13:43.870
to investigate what you mentioned.

304
13:44.150 --> 13:45.320
By 4 p.m. today,

305
13:45.320 --> 13:46.250
pack your things

306
13:46.510 --> 13:48.510
and move out of the staff dormitory.

307
13:49.830 --> 13:51.390
[Beijing Bank]

308
14:05.130 --> 14:05.400
[Calls]

309
14:05.400 --> 14:10.810
[Contact]

310
14:10.830 --> 14:12.000
[Liu Zhengguang]

311
14:31.200 --> 14:32.270
Work starts at 8 p.m.

312
14:32.270 --> 14:33.720
until 8 a.m. the next day.

313
14:34.120 --> 14:35.480
Our unit doesn't attract thieves.

314
14:35.480 --> 14:37.670
If there's nothing to do, you can nap on the bed.

315
14:37.670 --> 14:38.720
But when the driver comes back,

316
14:38.720 --> 14:39.910
he might knock on the window,

317
14:39.910 --> 14:41.600
and you have to help move people.

318
14:41.600 --> 14:42.320
Do you understand what I mean?

319
14:42.320 --> 14:43.120
I understand.

320
14:43.200 --> 14:44.000
Then come in.

321
14:47.000 --> 14:48.960
Zhao will come to take over

322
14:48.960 --> 14:50.600
your shift tomorrow morning.

323
14:50.600 --> 14:51.600
You two will share

324
14:51.600 --> 14:52.720
daily necessities and what not.

325
14:52.720 --> 14:53.600
If you're cold,

326
14:53.790 --> 14:55.080
there's an electric stove

327
14:55.080 --> 14:56.480
and an electric blanket.

328
14:56.510 --> 14:57.720
Be very careful.

329
14:57.790 --> 14:59.250
Don't exceed 2,000 watts.

330
14:59.270 --> 15:00.270
In this room,

331
15:00.440 --> 15:01.270
the wires are thin

332
15:01.270 --> 15:02.390
and easily short-circuit.

333
15:02.390 --> 15:04.200
Anyway, if anything happens,

334
15:04.390 --> 15:05.590
come find me anytime.

335
15:05.670 --> 15:06.630
Zhengguang's friend

336
15:06.630 --> 15:07.720
is my friend.

337
15:08.750 --> 15:09.880
Thank you, brother.

338
15:11.600 --> 15:12.530
President Long,

339
15:12.790 --> 15:14.520
many old neighbors came today.

340
15:14.790 --> 15:17.250
Some have been standing here since morning,

341
15:17.550 --> 15:19.880
and some even rushed back from out of town.

342
15:20.030 --> 15:23.120
Xiaoximen Hospital has stood on this street for so many years.

343
15:23.120 --> 15:24.850
How many people were born here?

344
15:25.120 --> 15:27.550
How many people have finished their last journey here?

345
15:27.550 --> 15:28.600
How many late nights

346
15:28.600 --> 15:30.260
were the lights still on here?

347
15:30.510 --> 15:32.030
Today, it's coming to an end.

348
15:32.030 --> 15:33.320
How do you feel?

349
15:33.720 --> 15:34.910
Do you have anything to say to these

350
15:34.910 --> 15:36.600
old neighbors who rushed here?

351
15:36.110 --> 15:41.410
[Filming]

352
15:36.870 --> 15:37.960
First of all,

353
15:39.030 --> 15:40.440
I support all the decisions

354
15:40.440 --> 15:41.790
made by the responsible authorities.

355
15:41.790 --> 15:44.790
Xiaoximen Hospital indeed has its own difficulties.

356
15:45.440 --> 15:48.290
Its conditions are not as good as those big hospitals,

357
15:48.290 --> 15:51.780
[Filming]

358
15:48.910 --> 15:50.960
but for everyone, you can see a doctor

359
15:50.960 --> 15:52.200
just by walking a few steps.

360
15:52.200 --> 15:54.360
You don't have to line up in the dark to register.

361
15:54.360 --> 15:56.960
It's the first place nearby residents think of

362
15:57.150 --> 15:58.480
when they get sick.

363
15:59.240 --> 15:59.790
That's right.

364
15:59.790 --> 16:00.910
Right.

365
16:02.150 --> 16:05.270
Xiaoximen Hospital indeed can't compare with big hospitals,

366
16:05.270 --> 16:06.240
but it allows

367
16:06.240 --> 16:08.790
the surrounding residents to see a doctor.

368
16:06.810 --> 16:15.710
[Filming]

369
16:09.600 --> 16:11.080
It gives them a choice.

370
16:11.440 --> 16:13.480
You can't leave the common people with

371
16:13.480 --> 16:14.390
no options when they need to see a doctor, right?

372
16:14.390 --> 16:15.480
-Yeah. -Xiao Long.

373
16:15.960 --> 16:16.870
For what you just said,

374
16:16.870 --> 16:18.440
I have to give you a thumbs up.

375
16:18.440 --> 16:19.840
I trust Xiaoximen Hospital.

376
16:19.840 --> 16:21.240
Let me say a few words too.

377
16:21.240 --> 16:23.240
When people get old,

378
16:21.760 --> 16:25.040
[Filming]

379
16:23.240 --> 16:24.910
they have a lot of troubles and illnesses.

380
16:24.910 --> 16:25.630
Right?

381
16:26.080 --> 16:27.150
In the past,

382
16:27.150 --> 16:29.270
when we had any illnesses or diseases,

383
16:29.270 --> 16:30.510
we went to Xiaoximen Hospital.

384
16:30.510 --> 16:31.870
Xiaoximen Hospital didn't despise us.

385
16:31.870 --> 16:32.550
Right?

386
16:32.600 --> 16:33.200
Right.

387
16:33.200 --> 16:34.030
But now,

388
16:34.030 --> 16:35.720
you are closing Xiaoximen Hospital.

389
16:35.720 --> 16:36.840
Then when we get sick in the future,

390
16:36.840 --> 16:37.720
who are we going to look for?

391
16:37.720 --> 16:38.390
Yes.

392
16:38.390 --> 16:39.080
Right?

393
16:41.030 --> 16:42.960
This brother is right.

394
16:43.000 --> 16:43.600
Right.

395
16:44.510 --> 16:46.390
Although Xiaoximen Hospital is small,

396
16:46.390 --> 16:47.960
it has made a lot of contributions.

397
16:47.500 --> 16:50.790
[Filming]

398
16:47.960 --> 16:48.440
Right.

399
16:48.440 --> 16:50.120
Take me for example.

400
16:50.320 --> 16:52.720
I have this complicated medical condition

401
16:52.750 --> 16:54.240
and wasn't it cured

402
16:54.240 --> 16:54.960
by that doctor surnamed Liu

403
16:54.960 --> 16:55.870
in no time?

404
16:56.030 --> 16:57.120
Yes, exactly.

405
16:57.120 --> 16:59.000
Xiaoximen Hospital may be average,

406
16:59.000 --> 17:00.670
but for us common people,

407
17:00.960 --> 17:01.690
it's enough.

408
17:01.790 --> 17:03.080
Right.

409
17:03.080 --> 17:04.400
What is good?

410
17:04.460 --> 17:09.020
[Filming]

411
17:04.550 --> 17:05.960
Suitable is good.

412
17:05.960 --> 17:06.960
Am I right, everyone?

413
17:06.960 --> 17:08.240
Right.

414
17:08.510 --> 17:09.109
Right.

415
17:09.240 --> 17:11.030
Xiaoximen Hospital can't be closed.

416
17:11.030 --> 17:13.630
If it's closed, where will we go to see a doctor?

417
17:31.550 --> 17:31.960
Hello.

418
17:32.030 --> 17:33.160
Hello, Zhengliang.

419
17:33.200 --> 17:33.880
Brother,

420
17:33.960 --> 17:35.000
you finally answered the phone.

421
17:35.000 --> 17:35.590
Look at how many calls

422
17:35.590 --> 17:36.640
I made to you.

423
17:37.440 --> 17:37.880
I even thought

424
17:37.880 --> 17:39.070
you were kidnapped.

425
17:39.350 --> 17:40.720
Kidnapped?

426
17:41.310 --> 17:42.920
I'm not a kid anymore.

427
17:43.640 --> 17:45.440
I won't get lost. Don't worry.

428
17:45.440 --> 17:46.480
Who says?

429
17:47.830 --> 17:48.920
Do you remember

430
17:49.000 --> 17:50.530
when we were in high school,

431
17:50.680 --> 17:52.200
you ran away from home

432
17:52.640 --> 17:54.200
and actually got lost?

433
17:54.830 --> 17:55.590
In the end, I remember

434
17:55.590 --> 17:56.640
it was the police

435
17:56.640 --> 17:57.840
who found you, right?

436
17:58.200 --> 17:58.880
At that time,

437
17:58.880 --> 18:00.000
you were already 18

438
18:00.000 --> 18:01.400
and officially an adult.

439
18:01.400 --> 18:02.920
Why talk about that year?

440
18:03.640 --> 18:04.440
Why don't you talk about

441
18:04.440 --> 18:06.310
getting beaten up when you were a kid?

442
18:06.310 --> 18:09.170
Not talking about it doesn't mean I don't remember.

443
18:12.830 --> 18:14.030
When will you be back?

444
18:16.720 --> 18:17.920
In a little while.

445
18:17.920 --> 18:19.180
I want to hide for a bit.

446
18:22.070 --> 18:22.960
I understand.

447
18:22.960 --> 18:24.220
I totally understand.

448
18:25.030 --> 18:26.760
I've thought about hiding too.

449
18:27.400 --> 18:28.550
Did you succeed?

450
18:29.880 --> 18:30.880
What do you think?

451
18:32.400 --> 18:33.590
Let me tell you something.

452
18:33.590 --> 18:35.520
Sometimes the more you try to hide,

453
18:35.750 --> 18:37.550
the less you can get away from it.

454
18:39.590 --> 18:40.790
Then what should I do?

455
18:40.830 --> 18:41.960
What can you do?

456
18:42.440 --> 18:43.550
Just keep living.

457
18:45.720 --> 18:47.120
Don't worry. I won't die.

458
18:49.310 --> 18:50.970
I'll wait for you to come back.

459
18:57.070 --> 18:57.790
If my phone

460
18:57.790 --> 18:59.160
loses signal later

461
19:00.070 --> 19:01.330
and you can't reach me,

462
19:03.000 --> 19:04.310
help me tell my parents

463
19:05.640 --> 19:06.590
that I'm safe.

464
19:06.790 --> 19:08.160
Wait, where are you that

465
19:08.160 --> 19:09.220
there's no signal?

466
19:14.480 --> 19:15.510
A good place.

467
19:15.880 --> 19:16.960
What good place?

468
19:17.310 --> 19:18.170
I'm hanging up.

469
19:33.750 --> 19:34.640
Chen Junnan!

470
19:39.960 --> 19:40.750
Chen Junnan!

471
19:41.200 --> 19:41.880
Zhang Hao!

472
19:42.640 --> 19:43.270
You—

473
19:44.030 --> 19:44.960
What's with this outfit?

474
19:44.960 --> 19:46.000
Come, give it to me.

475
19:46.000 --> 19:46.680
The luggage.

476
19:46.680 --> 19:47.680
Hello, hello, hello.

477
19:47.680 --> 19:48.880
Hello, hello, hello.

478
19:49.790 --> 19:50.510
You—

479
19:50.750 --> 19:52.030
You look completely different.

480
19:52.030 --> 19:52.680
Right?

481
19:54.510 --> 19:55.710
You came by yourself?

482
19:55.920 --> 19:57.180
Yeah, I came by myself.

483
19:57.880 --> 19:59.280
I wasn't bragging, was I?

484
19:59.830 --> 20:01.550
Snowfields, big forest.

485
20:01.550 --> 20:02.310
See that?

486
20:02.750 --> 20:03.550
Isn't it cool?

487
20:03.640 --> 20:04.640
This is great.

488
20:10.110 --> 20:12.160
This is the life we yearn for.

489
20:29.440 --> 20:30.310
Just this outer layer.

490
20:30.310 --> 20:31.310
Didn't you say you didn't want it?

491
20:31.310 --> 20:32.680
You'll peel it bald.

492
20:32.720 --> 20:34.320
What are you doing with this?

493
20:36.480 --> 20:37.810
I have to do it like this.

494
20:38.350 --> 20:39.030
Right?

495
20:39.310 --> 20:39.910
Like this.

496
20:40.550 --> 20:41.240
Pound it.

497
20:41.830 --> 20:42.440
Like this?

498
20:43.270 --> 20:44.830
This is super simple.

499
20:44.920 --> 20:46.780
Not as complicated as dumplings.

500
20:47.480 --> 20:48.000
Just like this,

501
20:48.000 --> 20:49.530
your hand curves like this.

502
20:50.000 --> 20:51.260
How many have you made?

503
20:52.310 --> 20:53.310
How many people?

504
20:53.790 --> 20:54.640
Four people.

505
21:02.680 --> 21:03.590
See? Done.

506
21:06.550 --> 21:09.350
Dip it in water and wipe the edge of the plate clean.

507
21:09.480 --> 21:10.030
Okay.

508
21:16.480 --> 21:17.200
When I'm home,

509
21:17.200 --> 21:18.200
I make the cold dishes.

510
21:18.200 --> 21:19.310
Coming.

511
21:20.240 --> 21:21.680
That's incredible.

512
21:22.200 --> 21:23.030
Zhengliang, I...

513
21:23.030 --> 21:24.480
I thought you meant treating us to dinner

514
21:24.480 --> 21:25.200
at a restaurant.

515
21:25.200 --> 21:26.000
I didn't expect it to be at home.

516
21:26.000 --> 21:27.590
I didn't know you could cook.

517
21:27.590 --> 21:28.400
Ai Chen made it.

518
21:28.400 --> 21:29.730
No, we made it together.

519
21:29.750 --> 21:31.240
-You're amazing. -Never underestimate

520
21:31.240 --> 21:32.400
the hands-on skills

521
21:32.400 --> 21:33.160
of an excellent surgeon.

522
21:33.160 --> 21:33.960
Absolutely.

523
21:33.960 --> 21:36.420
Especially one who's lived alone for years.

524
21:37.880 --> 21:38.590
I almost forgot.

525
21:38.590 --> 21:39.830
I—I know what you want.

526
21:39.830 --> 21:41.920
-What are you getting? -No, don't. It's enough.

527
21:41.920 --> 21:44.030
-Six dishes for four. Enough. -Enough, this is plenty.

528
21:44.030 --> 21:44.510
Here.

529
21:44.510 --> 21:44.880
It's enough.

530
21:44.880 --> 21:45.270
For the trash.

531
21:45.270 --> 21:46.160
I know it's enough.

532
21:46.160 --> 21:47.480
There's plenty of this too. Come on.

533
21:47.480 --> 21:48.270
This...

534
21:48.270 --> 21:50.550
Are my eyes playing tricks on me?

535
21:51.030 --> 21:52.680
Wait, didn't you say you don't drink?

536
21:52.680 --> 21:53.640
Just because I don't drink

537
21:53.640 --> 21:55.070
doesn't mean you can't.

538
21:55.720 --> 21:56.590
Zhengliang,

539
21:56.590 --> 21:57.200
what you just said

540
21:57.200 --> 21:58.880
really warms my heart.

541
21:58.960 --> 21:59.680
Zhengliang...

542
21:59.680 --> 22:00.270
Come on.

543
22:00.270 --> 22:01.400
You're good to go now.

544
22:01.400 --> 22:02.880
Come on, let's start!

545
22:03.750 --> 22:04.510
Well,

546
22:04.510 --> 22:05.720
before we get started,

547
22:05.720 --> 22:07.000
I'd like to say a few words.

548
22:07.000 --> 22:07.720
Is that okay?

549
22:07.720 --> 22:08.550
S-Sure.

550
22:08.550 --> 22:10.030
Yes, absolutely.

551
22:10.510 --> 22:11.510
Here's the thing.

552
22:11.960 --> 22:13.290
The reason for this meal

553
22:13.790 --> 22:14.830
is that I wanted

554
22:15.110 --> 22:16.110
to invite you all,

555
22:16.230 --> 22:17.790
along with Chen Junnan

556
22:17.880 --> 22:19.410
and my brother Zhengguang.

557
22:19.550 --> 22:21.000
I just wanted to thank you all

558
22:21.000 --> 22:22.720
for taking care of me

559
22:22.830 --> 22:23.920
during this time.

560
22:25.350 --> 22:26.270
But then...

561
22:27.000 --> 22:28.880
Zhengguang went to Beijing,

562
22:28.920 --> 22:30.640
and Chen Junnan isn't here either.

563
22:30.640 --> 22:32.240
But I said I'd treat you,

564
22:32.310 --> 22:34.510
-so I had to, right? -Of course.

565
22:36.030 --> 22:37.030
So anyway—

566
22:45.000 --> 22:46.110
W-Well, eat up and drink up!

567
22:46.110 --> 22:46.920
All right.

568
22:47.640 --> 22:48.440
Great!

569
22:48.480 --> 22:49.510
Cheers! Cheers!

570
22:52.030 --> 22:53.310
Who is it at this hour?

571
22:54.110 --> 22:54.920
Let's have a drink first.

572
22:54.920 --> 22:55.980
Let's drink first.

573
22:57.640 --> 22:59.550
Jin, Secretary Lyu,

574
22:59.640 --> 23:00.570
why are you here?

575
23:01.070 --> 23:02.750
We heard Chief Physician Liu was treating,

576
23:02.750 --> 23:04.030
and we thought it was quite rare,

577
23:04.030 --> 23:05.240
so we came uninvited.

578
23:05.720 --> 23:06.850
Hope you don't mind.

579
23:07.310 --> 23:08.110
Who told you

580
23:08.110 --> 23:09.110
I was treating?

581
23:10.160 --> 23:11.000
Huang.

582
23:12.110 --> 23:12.770
You said it?

583
23:17.000 --> 23:18.680
I... I came with him.

584
23:18.680 --> 23:18.920
Yes.

585
23:18.920 --> 23:19.920
I came with him.

586
23:20.200 --> 23:21.070
We brought some fruit.

587
23:21.070 --> 23:21.920
It's all from before,

588
23:21.920 --> 23:23.920
gifts people sent to the president.

589
23:25.240 --> 23:25.920
Hey, even if you're coughing,

590
23:25.920 --> 23:28.180
they were still gifts from someone else.

591
23:28.830 --> 23:30.750
Don't worry. I picked them out.

592
23:30.750 --> 23:32.550
All good fruit, nothing rotten.

593
23:33.640 --> 23:34.510
Chief Physician Liu, here's the thing.

594
23:34.510 --> 23:36.440
Everyone's been having a rough time lately.

595
23:36.440 --> 23:38.040
I'm sure you can understand.

596
23:39.160 --> 23:40.240
Well, um...

597
23:40.240 --> 23:40.880
Come—come in.

598
23:40.880 --> 23:42.030
It's freezing outside.

599
23:42.030 --> 23:43.560
Since you're already here.

600
23:44.270 --> 23:45.000
Should we change our shoes?

601
23:45.000 --> 23:45.830
It's fine, no need.

602
23:45.830 --> 23:46.400
Come in.

603
23:49.000 --> 23:49.720
There might not be enough food.

604
23:49.720 --> 23:50.750
I'll whip up two more dishes.

605
23:50.750 --> 23:51.550
No need.

606
23:51.880 --> 23:52.830
Enough, enough, enough.

607
23:52.830 --> 23:53.750
Six dishes for six people.

608
23:53.750 --> 23:54.550
It's more than enough.

609
23:54.550 --> 23:55.310
It's enough. It's enough.

610
23:55.310 --> 23:55.720
Alright then.

611
23:55.720 --> 23:56.920
I... I don't eat much.

612
23:57.270 --> 23:58.350
Then let's eat while it's hot.

613
23:58.350 --> 23:58.750
Okay.

614
23:58.750 --> 23:59.680
Let's start over.

615
23:59.680 --> 24:00.030
Let's start.

616
24:00.030 --> 24:00.510
Okay.

617
24:00.510 --> 24:02.160
What about Chen Junnan?

618
24:02.270 --> 24:03.730
Aren't you a group of four?

619
24:05.790 --> 24:07.650
He went off to cultivate himself.

620
24:09.070 --> 24:10.110
Cultivation is good.

621
24:10.110 --> 24:12.440
There are inevitably some hurdles in life.

622
24:12.440 --> 24:13.160
Exactly.

623
24:13.160 --> 24:14.720
Then let's drink to cultivation.

624
24:14.720 --> 24:15.200
How about it?

625
24:15.200 --> 24:16.230
Come on, cheers!

626
24:16.230 --> 24:17.920
To cultivation! Come on!

627
24:34.550 --> 24:35.790
I Heard Chief Physician Liu's hosting dinner.

628
24:35.790 --> 24:36.790
I was so curious.

629
24:36.790 --> 24:37.440
So I came uninvited.

630
24:37.440 --> 24:38.350
Sorry. I'm sorry.

631
24:38.350 --> 24:39.550
Chief Physician Liu.

632
24:39.720 --> 24:41.200
You didn't even invite us to your treat.

633
24:41.200 --> 24:42.270
That's not cool at all.

634
24:42.270 --> 24:44.440
Liu, I even made two dishes.

635
24:44.640 --> 24:46.370
And brought you some pastries.

636
24:46.680 --> 24:48.080
No, no, no. Wait a minute.

637
24:48.110 --> 24:49.400
Who did you hear it from?

638
24:49.400 --> 24:50.720
I heard it from him.

639
24:53.920 --> 24:55.270
Should we change our shoes?

640
24:55.270 --> 24:56.550
Let's talk inside.

641
24:56.830 --> 24:57.480
It's cold outside.

642
24:57.480 --> 24:58.790
I heard it from them!

643
24:59.920 --> 25:01.160
I heard it from them!

644
25:01.680 --> 25:03.310
I knew you two would show up.

645
25:03.440 --> 25:04.920
Everyone's curious, right?

646
25:04.920 --> 25:05.310
Yes.

647
25:05.310 --> 25:07.070
Well, didn't the hospital close down?

648
25:07.070 --> 25:08.000
We have no work.

649
25:08.400 --> 25:09.720
We're idle anyway.

650
25:10.030 --> 25:11.160
Wait, one question.

651
25:11.480 --> 25:12.750
Who else did you tell?

652
25:13.310 --> 25:14.070
No one.

653
25:14.110 --> 25:14.750
No one.

654
25:14.750 --> 25:16.510
I was just going to have dinner with these two.

655
25:16.510 --> 25:18.310
Otherwise, I wouldn't have even told them.

656
25:18.310 --> 25:19.110
Well...

657
25:19.110 --> 25:20.400
Basically, almost.

658
25:20.720 --> 25:21.480
Not basically.

659
25:21.480 --> 25:22.070
Absolutely no one else.

660
25:22.070 --> 25:23.330
There should be no one.

661
25:23.920 --> 25:25.450
There's no more room to sit.

662
25:25.680 --> 25:26.720
Let's squeeze in.

663
25:27.000 --> 25:28.440
If anyone else comes,

664
25:28.440 --> 25:29.400
we'll have to sit on each other's laps.

665
25:29.400 --> 25:30.460
Take off your coat.

666
25:42.510 --> 25:43.570
Take off your coat.

667
25:49.030 --> 25:49.960
There's more?

668
25:50.790 --> 25:51.920
Why didn't you invite

669
25:51.920 --> 25:52.880
the whole hospital?

670
25:52.880 --> 25:53.750
We really have to sit on each other's laps.

671
25:53.750 --> 25:54.590
Was it you, bro?

672
25:54.590 --> 25:55.550
What's going on?

673
25:55.720 --> 25:57.200
No, I-I'm tight-lipped.

674
25:57.590 --> 25:59.310
You're tight-lipped? Yet someone's knocking.

675
25:59.310 --> 25:59.970
I didn't...

676
26:36.310 --> 26:37.030
You do it.

677
26:39.400 --> 26:40.030
Welcome!

678
26:40.480 --> 26:41.940
Welcome, President Long!

679
26:53.160 --> 26:54.750
Do you think Director Yan

680
26:55.160 --> 26:56.070
thinks that

681
26:56.070 --> 26:59.310
since Xiaoximen is disbanded,

682
26:59.310 --> 27:01.270
we should all be at home

683
27:01.270 --> 27:02.680
crying our eyes out?

684
27:04.030 --> 27:05.070
We won't do that!

685
27:05.070 --> 27:05.750
Right!

686
27:05.750 --> 27:07.110
We've worked hard for most of our lives.

687
27:07.110 --> 27:09.270
We finally have some time

688
27:09.270 --> 27:10.750
to get a good rest at home.

689
27:10.750 --> 27:11.550
Isn't that nice?

690
27:11.550 --> 27:12.350
Right.

691
27:12.680 --> 27:13.880
I don't want to rest.

692
27:14.030 --> 27:15.920
I don't know what to do when I'm free.

693
27:15.920 --> 27:17.070
Ask Ai Chen.

694
27:17.640 --> 27:18.480
Me?

695
27:19.440 --> 27:20.960
Do whatever you want.

696
27:21.240 --> 27:22.110
He is him. I am me.

697
27:22.110 --> 27:24.170
I've never told you what to do, right?

698
27:24.480 --> 27:25.680
Right, well said.

699
27:26.640 --> 27:27.270
People

700
27:27.270 --> 27:29.070
shouldn't always think about work.

701
27:29.070 --> 27:31.000
Whether you're busy or not,

702
27:31.440 --> 27:33.300
you have to know how to enjoy life.

703
27:33.590 --> 27:34.400
Right.

704
27:38.070 --> 27:42.240
You once told me

705
27:42.480 --> 27:43.440
What a voice.

706
27:43.440 --> 27:47.830
that meeting is a song.

707
27:49.480 --> 27:55.240
Eyes are the sea of spring.

708
27:55.480 --> 28:00.350
Youth is a green river.

709
28:00.920 --> 28:06.070
Meeting is a song.

710
28:06.240 --> 28:11.030
Walking together, you and me.

711
28:10.730 --> 28:11.740
Pitch perfect!

712
28:11.440 --> 28:17.240
The heart is a young sun,

713
28:17.350 --> 28:22.400
sincere and lively.

714
28:23.440 --> 28:27.960
Meeting is a song.

715
28:28.070 --> 28:32.830
Walking together, you and me.

716
28:33.350 --> 28:38.310
The heart is a young sun,

717
28:38.510 --> 28:43.200
sincere and lively.

718
28:45.920 --> 28:47.310
Great! Let's drink!

719
28:47.480 --> 28:49.160
That song deserves a toast! Come on!

720
28:49.160 --> 28:50.440
Have to drink to that!

721
28:50.440 --> 28:51.030
You sang so well!

722
28:51.030 --> 28:51.720
Come on!

723
28:51.720 --> 28:53.250
Someone forgot the lyrics.

724
28:53.680 --> 28:54.720
Someone forgot the lyrics.

725
28:54.720 --> 28:55.550
Who forgot the lyrics?

726
28:55.550 --> 28:57.610
That was the most in-sync we've been.

727
28:57.920 --> 28:58.720
Dr. Liu.

728
28:59.160 --> 28:59.960
Zhengliang.

729
29:00.590 --> 29:01.270
Here, drink this.

730
29:01.270 --> 29:02.730
Take a sip of this. Come on.

731
29:02.920 --> 29:04.240
What? What?

732
29:04.720 --> 29:05.440
Come on.

733
29:05.590 --> 29:06.480
What are you doing?

734
29:06.480 --> 29:07.110
He's happy.

735
29:07.110 --> 29:08.350
No. You drink this.

736
29:08.550 --> 29:10.110
I saved it especially for you!

737
29:10.110 --> 29:11.590
-I saved it for you! -He can't.

738
29:11.590 --> 29:12.480
Enough, Huang.

739
29:12.480 --> 29:13.270
Here we go again.

740
29:13.270 --> 29:14.270
I don't drink.

741
29:14.920 --> 29:15.880
Drink, drink.

742
29:15.880 --> 29:16.960
I can't drink.

743
29:16.960 --> 29:18.240
Drink, just a little.

744
29:18.680 --> 29:19.480
I beg you.

745
29:19.480 --> 29:21.750
Red wine and baijiu aren't the same thing.

746
29:21.750 --> 29:23.270
Huang, you're drunk.

747
29:23.270 --> 29:23.920
It's all alcohol.

748
29:23.920 --> 29:25.350
What's the difference?

749
29:25.790 --> 29:27.790
This red wine looks like blood to me.

750
29:27.790 --> 29:29.250
Doesn't it make you dizzy?

751
29:29.270 --> 29:30.110
No.

752
29:30.960 --> 29:33.000
Wine is wine. Blood is blood.

753
29:33.000 --> 29:34.480
I'm a surgeon!

754
29:34.750 --> 29:36.680
That's tough, going into surgery.

755
29:37.640 --> 29:39.480
Thank you, Long!

756
29:40.400 --> 29:41.030
That's enough.

757
29:41.030 --> 29:41.720
Thanks!

758
29:41.720 --> 29:42.510
Don't throw up on me.

759
29:42.510 --> 29:44.170
You're in internal medicine.

760
29:46.510 --> 29:48.240
You'll crush the president.

761
29:48.960 --> 29:50.620
-You two help. -Go to the sofa.

762
29:51.400 --> 29:52.720
Don't bump into anything.

763
29:52.720 --> 29:55.380
-Be gentle. Give him a hand. -Careful, careful.

764
29:56.640 --> 29:57.240
Slow down.

765
29:57.680 --> 30:00.340
He has to sleep it off every time after drinking.

766
30:03.550 --> 30:04.680
Then we've got to do a toast.

767
30:04.680 --> 30:06.200
Come on!

768
30:06.790 --> 30:07.880
We've got to drink well!

769
30:07.880 --> 30:08.510
Come on!

770
30:09.510 --> 30:10.910
Let him sleep for a while.

771
30:10.920 --> 30:11.790
He'll sober up soon.

772
30:11.790 --> 30:13.200
Come on, let's drink.

773
30:13.480 --> 30:14.880
Are you okay, President?

774
30:15.310 --> 30:16.710
Didn't crush you, right?

775
30:18.400 --> 30:20.310
Huang used to be a surgeon.

776
30:25.720 --> 30:27.000
Around 1999, I think.

777
30:29.030 --> 30:30.480
He was young back then,

778
30:30.920 --> 30:32.310
just around thirty.

779
30:34.070 --> 30:35.880
We both worked at the First Mine Hospital.

780
30:35.880 --> 30:38.540
I was the director of the emergency department.

781
30:39.070 --> 30:41.790
He was my best

782
30:42.510 --> 30:44.110
surgical emergency doctor.

783
30:47.110 --> 30:48.000
Once,

784
30:48.550 --> 30:50.350
there was a major mine accident.

785
30:51.110 --> 30:52.350
Huang spent

786
30:53.510 --> 30:54.310
several days

787
30:55.110 --> 30:58.310
rescuing the wounded.

788
31:00.110 --> 31:01.110
He treated over a dozen

789
31:01.110 --> 31:02.840
critically injured patients.

790
31:06.510 --> 31:07.770
None of them survived.

791
32:13.590 --> 32:15.000
I was in charge of

792
32:15.310 --> 32:16.570
directing the rescue.

793
32:17.030 --> 32:18.240
I couldn't feel

794
32:18.270 --> 32:20.720
their feelings on the front line.

795
32:21.720 --> 32:23.120
Later, Huang broke down.

796
32:24.510 --> 32:25.680
His spirit, emotions, and ideals

797
32:25.680 --> 32:26.640
were shattered.

798
32:29.510 --> 32:30.270
And he ended up with

799
32:30.270 --> 32:32.330
that awful condition—blood phobia.

800
32:49.550 --> 32:50.350
Later on,

801
32:52.510 --> 32:54.840
I was transferred to the Second Hospital.

802
32:55.880 --> 32:56.720
And Huang,

803
32:59.400 --> 33:02.270
through his own hard work,

804
33:03.160 --> 33:06.360
finally transferred from surgery to internal medicine.

805
33:08.160 --> 33:09.420
But nobody wanted him.

806
33:10.240 --> 33:11.200
Nobody paid him any mind.

807
33:11.200 --> 33:12.730
I thought, what should I do?

808
33:14.310 --> 33:15.030
So I pulled some strings

809
33:15.030 --> 33:16.880
and got him into Xiaoximen.

810
33:17.200 --> 33:19.400
He's been here for almost twenty years.

811
33:24.400 --> 33:25.800
Everyone at the hospital

812
33:26.030 --> 33:27.480
thinks Huang

813
33:28.790 --> 33:29.750
has given up,

814
33:30.960 --> 33:32.560
just coasting through life.

815
33:32.790 --> 33:33.830
Only I know

816
33:35.350 --> 33:37.080
that's not what he wants at all.

817
33:37.200 --> 33:38.400
He doesn't want this.

818
33:41.750 --> 33:43.210
This isn't what he wanted.

819
33:53.000 --> 33:54.550
Why did we become doctors?

820
33:56.480 --> 33:58.210
Have you ever thought about it?

821
33:59.720 --> 34:01.000
We study longer

822
34:01.000 --> 34:02.160
than anyone else,

823
34:02.590 --> 34:03.480
work harder,

824
34:03.480 --> 34:04.920
day and night,

825
34:05.030 --> 34:06.830
and still don't make much money.

826
34:07.440 --> 34:09.150
You're so right.

827
34:10.070 --> 34:13.510
Doctors are practically a high-risk profession now.

828
34:13.670 --> 34:15.360
If my dad hadn't gotten sick,

829
34:15.550 --> 34:17.480
I wouldn't have studied medicine.

830
34:18.070 --> 34:19.760
But once you become a doctor,

831
34:21.110 --> 34:21.960
you always feel

832
34:21.960 --> 34:23.560
there's something up ahead,

833
34:24.480 --> 34:26.340
and you just want to run toward it,

834
34:26.840 --> 34:28.190
and chase it.

835
34:29.670 --> 34:30.510
But,

836
34:32.590 --> 34:34.070
how does that saying go?

837
34:34.280 --> 34:35.630
Like feet without a bird,

838
34:35.630 --> 34:36.510
and then I just

839
34:36.840 --> 34:37.760
can't stop.

840
34:40.070 --> 34:41.510
Feet without a bird?

841
34:41.590 --> 34:42.719
A bird without feet.

842
34:50.710 --> 34:51.770
What are you doing?

843
34:52.030 --> 34:53.110
To our profession.

844
34:55.550 --> 34:56.150
Here.

845
34:56.190 --> 34:56.840
Here.

846
34:57.280 --> 34:57.920
To doctors!

847
34:57.920 --> 34:58.710
To doctors! Come on!

848
34:58.710 --> 34:59.510
To doctors!

849
35:01.510 --> 35:02.840
To all medical workers.

850
35:17.370 --> 35:20.520
♪ A soul that came to earth amid the cries ♪

851
35:20.970 --> 35:24.140
♪ Welcome to this city of haste ♪

852
35:24.580 --> 35:26.940
♪ Grow taller, quick as you can ♪

853
35:27.240 --> 35:29.500
♪ Learn how to find your footing ♪

854
35:31.770 --> 35:35.140
♪ A soul who hid among the lanes and alleys ♪

855
35:35.540 --> 35:38.810
♪ A single turn, and the lamp at the door grows distant ♪

856
35:39.140 --> 35:41.530
♪ The ticket bears no way back ♪

857
35:41.820 --> 35:44.210
♪ How like life it is ♪

858
35:46.530 --> 35:48.890
♪ May every road you take be safe ♪

859
35:49.160 --> 35:53.270
♪ May the scenery stay simple and carry you past regret ♪

860
35:53.810 --> 35:56.810
♪ Love deeply whatever comes to meet you ♪

861
35:57.400 --> 36:00.580
♪ And let those who leave be buried under snow on the hills ♪

862
36:01.090 --> 36:03.510
♪ May you come home covered in dust ♪

863
36:03.910 --> 36:07.820
♪ Held by what you love as you roam the world and return ♪

864
36:09.170 --> 36:13.430
♪ Saying the flowers by the door are truly beautiful ♪

865
36:19.450 --> 36:22.690
♪ You'll pass through the seasons, through dawn and dusk ♪

866
36:22.960 --> 36:27.580
[Chen Junnan]

867
36:23.040 --> 36:26.230
♪ Hearing someone call your name, again and again ♪

868
36:26.660 --> 36:28.970
♪ These ties may hurt a little ♪

869
36:29.550 --> 36:31.630
♪ Don't heal a broken heart ♪

870
36:34.020 --> 36:37.070
♪ It will bear witness to the life you bravely lived ♪

871
36:37.550 --> 36:40.710
♪ To the beautiful souls you've loved ♪

872
36:41.210 --> 36:43.450
♪ To the address you call home ♪

873
36:43.930 --> 36:46.560
♪ In the little town you've wandered through ♪

874
36:49.450 --> 36:51.630
♪ The wind in the city ♪

875
36:52.070 --> 36:54.810
♪ Blows through dreams that flicker between light and dark ♪

876
36:55.690 --> 36:58.370
♪ Blows through one soul's radiance ♪

877
36:59.990 --> 37:02.520
♪ And all its weathered scars ♪

878
37:03.860 --> 37:06.170
♪ Blows through the depths of winter ♪

879
37:06.460 --> 37:09.340
♪ Stumbling along in the wind ♪

880
37:10.330 --> 37:12.900
♪ Flickering along in the wind ♪

881
37:14.550 --> 37:20.420
♪ Toward the crossroads brimming with sunlight ♪

882
37:16.060 --> 37:23.710
[Registration]

883
37:23.710 --> 37:31.940
[The Return of the Condor Heroes]

884
37:24.000 --> 37:27.280
♪ May every road you take be safe ♪

885
37:27.460 --> 37:31.480
♪ May the scenery stay simple and carry you past regret ♪

886
37:32.160 --> 37:35.180
♪ Love deeply whatever comes to meet you ♪

887
37:35.490 --> 37:36.250
[Xinhua Dictionary]

888
37:35.620 --> 37:38.720
♪ And let those who leave be buried under snow on the hills ♪

889
37:36.270 --> 37:39.310
[The Return of the Condor Heroes]

890
37:39.380 --> 37:41.820
♪ May you come home covered in dust ♪

891
37:42.090 --> 37:46.020
♪ Held by what you love as you roam the world and return ♪

892
37:44.880 --> 37:45.590
San.

893
37:45.880 --> 37:47.110
Put this on,

894
37:47.190 --> 37:48.630
and the shelf will be full.

895
37:47.220 --> 37:51.450
♪ Saying she was so beautiful in front of the door ♪

896
37:48.840 --> 37:50.880
I'll come look with you every day.

897
37:50.960 --> 37:53.670
Once we've seen enough, maybe we won't want to take it.

898
37:53.670 --> 37:54.920
Fight fire with fire.

899
37:57.150 --> 37:58.030
I really didn't expect

900
37:57.880 --> 38:00.030
[Linmon Express]

901
37:58.670 --> 38:00.480
you to help out last time.

902
38:00.590 --> 38:01.280
It was nothing.

903
38:01.280 --> 38:02.510
We happen to be short of hands here.

904
38:02.510 --> 38:05.170
The station manager said you could come to talk.

905
38:05.440 --> 38:06.190
Work hard.

906
38:05.550 --> 38:07.660
[Bulk Sorting Area]

907
38:07.840 --> 38:08.630
Come.

908
38:09.590 --> 38:10.400
Manager.

909
38:10.960 --> 38:12.230
I brought Zhengguang.

910
38:12.550 --> 38:14.880
Zhengguang, this is our station manager.

911
38:20.710 --> 38:21.640
Hello, Manager.

912
38:37.710 --> 38:38.970
Why are you still here?

913
38:39.000 --> 38:39.800
You're awake.

914
38:42.710 --> 38:44.240
If I leave, what will you do?

915
38:47.000 --> 38:47.760
Someone has to

916
38:47.760 --> 38:49.110
clean up this mess.

917
38:52.760 --> 38:53.550
Thank you.

918
39:09.480 --> 39:10.880
Why are you staring at me?

919
39:23.670 --> 39:24.880
I want to treat you.

920
39:29.070 --> 39:30.320
You want to treat me?

921
39:38.190 --> 39:40.440
Yes, I'll treat your chionophobia.

922
39:44.400 --> 39:46.130
I have to make sure you can stay.

923
39:47.590 --> 39:49.710
Okay, thank you.

924
39:50.280 --> 39:51.030
But for my illness,

925
39:51.030 --> 39:51.800
I can only endure it.

926
39:51.800 --> 39:52.880
Endure it?

927
39:54.000 --> 39:55.800
Aren't you avoiding the problem?

928
39:55.800 --> 39:57.320
You're just like Huang.

929
39:57.590 --> 39:59.790
It's been over ten years for him, right?

930
40:01.360 --> 40:02.110
His hemophobia

931
40:02.110 --> 40:03.480
has never been cured.

932
40:05.630 --> 40:07.290
Just let me endure it with you,

933
40:07.320 --> 40:08.710
and hope every year

934
40:08.710 --> 40:09.920
that it won't snow.

935
40:14.710 --> 40:16.370
I'm not avoiding the problem.

936
40:16.800 --> 40:18.150
I've seen many doctors

937
40:18.320 --> 40:19.440
and experts.

938
40:19.670 --> 40:22.670
-They all said... -It depends on man's will, you know?

939
40:23.920 --> 40:25.480
You just need to promise me,

940
40:26.670 --> 40:28.600
and then we'll work on it together.

941
40:55.320 --> 40:55.920
Hello?

942
40:55.920 --> 40:56.880
What are you doing?

943
40:56.880 --> 40:58.680
Why did it take so long to answer?

944
40:59.110 --> 41:00.280
I was sleeping.

945
41:00.960 --> 41:01.880
Get downstairs, quick.

946
41:01.880 --> 41:02.590
Good news.

947
41:05.550 --> 41:06.670
Okay, wait for me.

948
41:22.630 --> 41:23.550
What are you doing?

949
41:23.550 --> 41:24.550
Scared?

950
41:25.510 --> 41:26.480
I'm treating you.

951
41:26.480 --> 41:28.740
Treating? What kind of treating is this?

952
41:29.550 --> 41:31.410
This is called exposure therapy.

953
41:31.440 --> 41:32.840
Also known as flooding therapy!

954
41:32.840 --> 41:33.630
Scared?

955
41:33.630 --> 41:35.840
It puts you deep in your fear,

956
41:35.920 --> 41:36.880
and then after two or three times,

957
41:36.880 --> 41:39.480
once you're not scared anymore, you're cured.

958
41:40.150 --> 41:41.150
If curing illnesses were this simple,

959
41:41.150 --> 41:42.410
there'd be no doctors.

960
41:42.550 --> 41:43.670
You're awesome!

961
41:44.230 --> 41:45.400
You held on!

962
41:46.480 --> 41:47.760
The inspiration came from

963
41:47.760 --> 41:48.840
us washing dishes.

964
41:51.110 --> 41:52.190
So when you said treating me,

965
41:52.190 --> 41:53.550
this is how you meant to do it?

966
41:53.550 --> 41:54.480
Great!

967
41:55.920 --> 41:56.840
All right, come down!

968
41:56.840 --> 41:57.590
Come down!

969
41:59.440 --> 42:00.630
Spread it evenly.

970
42:01.480 --> 42:02.940
All right, stop spraying!

971
42:04.880 --> 42:05.670
Done.

972
42:07.550 --> 42:08.950
Take a moment to recover.

973
42:09.190 --> 42:10.000
Wait for me!

974
42:10.000 --> 42:10.670
Easy, Chen.

975
42:13.510 --> 42:14.320
How was it?

976
42:15.960 --> 42:16.880
So realistic.

977
42:18.110 --> 42:18.960
How'd it feel?

978
42:19.000 --> 42:20.190
What's there to feel?

979
42:20.190 --> 42:21.960
This is foam, not snow.

980
42:23.000 --> 42:24.960
What do you mean? No—no feeling?

981
42:25.000 --> 42:26.230
You have no imagination.

982
42:26.230 --> 42:27.830
Can't you imagine it's snow?

983
42:28.280 --> 42:29.190
You need to feel

984
42:29.190 --> 42:30.030
the chilly wind

985
42:30.030 --> 42:31.000
and the heavy snow.

986
42:31.000 --> 42:31.710
I adjusted it for you.

987
42:31.710 --> 42:32.880
It's all heavy snow.

988
42:33.400 --> 42:35.030
I felt the chilly wind.

989
42:35.550 --> 42:36.400
But this...

990
42:36.480 --> 42:37.550
foam is foam.

991
42:37.550 --> 42:38.440
It's not snow.

992
42:38.440 --> 42:39.280
How can I imagine it?

993
42:39.280 --> 42:40.400
I'm not a goldfish.

994
42:42.070 --> 42:43.760
Why are you so stubborn?

995
42:44.630 --> 42:46.890
You run away when you face difficulties.

996
42:47.190 --> 42:48.760
When dealing with your illness,

997
42:48.760 --> 42:50.030
you need to show some willpower.

998
42:50.030 --> 42:50.840
You know?

999
42:51.400 --> 42:53.190
Come on, willpower?

1000
42:53.710 --> 42:54.550
Easy for you to say.

1001
42:54.550 --> 42:55.550
Why don't you use your willpower

1002
42:55.550 --> 42:57.190
to cure your illiteracy?

1003
43:02.230 --> 43:03.290
Keep provoking me.

1004
43:03.670 --> 43:04.800
No violence, okay?

1005
43:05.110 --> 43:06.000
Neither of us can escape.

1006
43:06.000 --> 43:06.760
You know?

1007
43:08.510 --> 43:10.040
I'll set an example for you.

1008
43:10.440 --> 43:11.550
I'll show you

1009
43:11.550 --> 43:13.000
how determined I am.
